    "body": "**[Download twig-macos-arm64.dmg](https://github.com/yasher3413/twig/releases/download/v0.1.3/twig-macos-arm64.dmg)**. Requires a Mac with an Apple chip (M1 or newer).\n\n### New\n- **Attach a screenshot to a bug report.** In Report a Bug, click *Attach a screenshot*, paste one with ⌘V, or drag an image onto the form. twig shrinks large images before sending. Screenshots become public along with the report, so leave out anything private.\n\n### Fixed\n- Bug reports sometimes failed with \"Couldn't reach the report service\". The report service no longer goes offline when twig's code is updated.\n\n### First launch\ntwig isn't notarized by Apple yet. The first time you open it, macOS says it can't verify the app. Go to **System Settings → Privacy & Security** and click **Open Anyway**.\n"
